      "text": "4 January: Victoria Island and the Arrayanes Forest"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:99d4ebb0270da8fa",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "bfbc158af4fbf8d1b6aff1aa52d5597ab678e7bfb0c1638339a8ce3b00a08d6d",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-0a822c5ae0173752",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "Spend another day cruising Lake Nahuel Huapi.\n\nThe catamaran trip is a shared group excursion.\n\nVictoria Island is the largest island in Lake Nahuel Huapi.\n\nThe island has several lagoons where you can spot peacocks, pheasants and cormorants.\n\nThe final part of the tour is a visit to the Arrayanes myrtle forest.\n\nThe Arrayanes Forest is considered the largest myrtle forest in the world.\n\nAfter the tour, return to Bariloche."
    },
